      "createdAt": "2026-07-01T18:12:25.304Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-09T10:01:28.481Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "d96d1e07-71fb-4063-85eb-ff7d8f583858",
      "phaseId": "73c320aa-b8b7-4fb3-9421-5c741b1771ff",
      "number": 4,
      "shortName": "sidebar-cutover-verify",
      "title": "Cutover sidebar to provider-mounted container + behavior preservation (T4)",
      "status": "planned",
      "description": "Cutover finale: sostituire il path bespoke di mount/render della sidebar con il container montato via provider. Render path legge ChromeHost::contributions(LeftSidebar) e painta il WidgetModel prodotto in T3. Ritirare il path bespoke sidebar. Preservare TUTTO il comportamento sidebar.\n\nLAVORO CONCRETO:\n1. Render path (heca/src/app/render.rs / chrome/mod.rs) legge ChromeHost::contributions(LeftSidebar) invece del path bespoke sidebar/.\n2. Rimuovere/ritirare il mount bespoke della sidebar (sidebar/render.rs path diretto).\n3. Preservare comportamento sidebar (verificare con test + manuale):\n   - nav j/k (up/down), h/l (tree-nav Left/Right)\n   - focus/activate (Enter, Right, l, secondo click in sidebar mode)\n   - rename (workspace/column/pane)\n   - mutation keys: w (workspace), c (column), v (split), z (zoom), d (delete pane), Shift+d (delete column)\n   - expand/collapse (Tab toggle, Space right-nav, b sidebar_left)\n   - Esc exit sidebar mode\n4. Route through ActionRegistry (no bypass), no hardcoded keys/theme (leggi da keybindings.default.toml mode \"sidebar\" + Theme).\n5. Test: nav/focus/mutation/expand. cargo check + cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets --all-features clean.\n\nRIFERIMENTI CODICE:\n- heca/src/app/render.rs — render path (content_rect/stable_tiled_content_rect)\n- heca/src/chrome/mod.rs — mount/chrome wiring attuale\n- heca/src/sidebar/render.rs — path bespoke da ritirare\n- heca/src/app/input.rs:601 — handle_sidebar_nav_mode (behavior da preservare)\n- keybindings.default.toml:250-322 — mode \"sidebar\" (tutti i binding da preservare)\n- heca/src/chrome/host.rs:138 — ChromeHost::contributions(region) (cosa legge il render path)\n\nDIPENDE DA: T2 (provider registrato) + T3 (WidgetModel reale).",
