    {
      "id": "f0c7d52f-ee67-4ab6-94d6-8d22ea51bc6e",
      "phaseId": "73c320aa-b8b7-4fb3-9421-5c741b1771ff",
      "number": 5,
      "shortName": "provider-skeleton-register",
      "title": "WorkspacesContainerProvider skeleton + ChromeHost registration (T2)",
      "status": "done",
      "description": "Creare il primo provider built-in come skeleton (no render seam reale ancora) e cablarlo in ChromeHost. Nessun cutover sidebar (resta bespoke in parallelo).\n\nCOMPLETATO 2026-07-09.\n\nLAVORO FATTO:\n1. Creato heca/src/providers/workspaces.rs con WorkspacesContainerProvider impl Provider: id=\"workspaces\", supported_regions=RegionSet::sidebars() (Left|Right), default_region=LeftSidebar, default_order=0, title=\"Workspaces\", movable=true, collapsible=true. build_contribution restituisce ContainerContribution placeholder con build closure che produce un Flex::column() vuoto (T3 t005 riempirà con il vero workspace-tree Flex).\n2. Aggiunto `mod workspaces;` + `pub use workspaces::WorkspacesContainerProvider;` in providers/mod.rs.\n3. Registrato il provider in app/startup.rs:327 (ChromeHost::new → mut chrome_host.register(Box::new(WorkspacesContainerProvider::new()))). Commento documenta: wiring-only, sidebar resta bespoke finché t006 non fa il cutover.\n4. 3 unit test in workspaces.rs::tests: provider_metadata_is_self_consistent, register_seats_in_left_sidebar_at_order_zero (verifica ChromeHost::contributions(LeftSidebar)=[workspaces], placement, RightSidebar vuota), build_contribution_returns_container_with_placeholder_body (verifica ContainerContribution + build closure callable senza panic).\n\nVERIFICA: cargo check clean, cargo test -p heca providers::workspaces 3/3 ok, cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets --all-features clean (solo preexisting block v0.1.6 future-incompat). Nessun cambiamento di behavior (render path build_chrome_root ancora chiama build_sidebar_shell direttamente, non legge ChromeHost).\n\nRIFERIMENTI CODICE:\n- heca/src/providers/workspaces.rs (nuovo) — WorkspacesContainerProvider\n- heca/src/providers/mod.rs — mod workspaces + pub use\n- heca/src/app/startup.rs:327 — registrazione (ChromeHost::new → register)\n- heca/src/chrome/host.rs:147 — ChromeHost::register (seats at default_region/order)\n- heca/src/chrome/contribution.rs:101 — ContainerContribution.build (render seam, placeholder ora)\n- heca/src/chrome/mod.rs:3208 build_chrome_root (NON ancora modificato — legge ancora build_sidebar_shell, cutover è T4 t006)",
